    `},{id:"news-4",slug:"neuorzin-recognized-visionary-cloud-orchestration-2026",title:"NeuOrzin Recognized as Visionary in High-Performance Cloud Orchestration 2026",releaseType:"Industry Recognition",date:"January 15, 2026",location:"Singapore",pressSummary:"Independent market intelligence firm highlights NeuOrzin for exceptional automated cloud migration velocity, FinOps telemetry precision, and zero-downtime microservice transitions.",tags:["Award","Cloud Architecture","Recognition"],fullRelease:`
